{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "6d119e296aba7b46dd9d962c49791371b6f8241f8056d0c87b1c95adda179a1b", "ja": "閃光☆HANABI団、最大の危機！？", "zh": "『闪光☆HANABI团』最大的危机！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c98f9c61ffca43d0a3077dc9a4f485c9dee90d9b2c4e4fc71c15dc946f6e1db3", "ja": "設営のためにキャンプに来たメンバー達。\n手伝いが順調に進む中、ついに海美の女子力\nやきそばが完成。だがつまみ食いをした\nのり子がノックダウン。ショックを受けた\n海美は、その場から走り去ってしまう。", "zh": "成员们为了搭建舞台而前来露营。\n在众人协助下顺利进行搭建工程的同时，\n海美的女子力炒面终于完成了。\n然而法子偷吃了一口便倒下，\n大受打击的海美因而跑离现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "48b3ce12bfbdcf901c128bd15a158a7d6d845e973314ad3dd171c0d204b41b71", "ja": "レッスンに屋台に、海のステージ設営。やる事が\n多いから、なんとかしないととは思っていたが……。", "zh": "要训练又要摆摊贩，还要搭建舞台。\n要做的事情很多，我确实是很希望能想出解决之道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e6eb104b17dc6ff1918f4158615c168964befcba16ea95993e39cffb269f8d6a", "ja": "まさかみんなで、キャンプする事になるとはな。", "zh": "但真没想到最后会变成大家一起跑来露营。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "d6b199059a868043055b96f12116f930c353d1dfe955bb7f8c16860d6bfa4a00", "ja": "あの、やっぱりご迷惑でしたか？\n{$P$}。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}，\n果然还是给你添麻烦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "3efc5fc068bdbe4a9c669f32737f83fb0e0c5246b65ba5eadc21b530750ea710", "ja": "キャンプ場で寝泊まりすれば、劇場も海のステージにも\n近くて、両方の作業がはかどると思って……。", "zh": "我想说住在露营地的话，距离剧场和海边舞台都很近，\n这样两边的工作都能顺利进行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fd0748aaef2da6802e3e43c82f6ca8bad64bef82efe4ace40b681533a3303cc4", "ja": "いや。提案された時は驚いたけど、想定以上のペースで\n作業できてるし、助かったよ。ありがとう、紗代子。", "zh": "不会啦，听到提议时我是有点吃惊，\n但这样作业进度比预期快，帮助很大。谢啦，纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "552e9d91fd8fe8edc703dbc40d41282fb8057e4c1959b6041373f564f5ac948f", "ja": "い、いえ！　こちらこそ、付き添っていただいて\nありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "不、不会！\n我才要谢谢你来陪我们，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "1eabd1acdb50e257ba8f95c13b026ea1e1a12d12b4f220256b9e29e11cafe348", "ja": "うーん♪　スパイシーで、いいにおいだね！\n海美ちゃん、女子力やきそば、これで完成？", "zh": "嗯～♪闻起来好辣好香喔！\n海美，这就是女子力炒面的完成品吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "603843af724a6ed6a71e34c287c2ceb9c6ceb725dae94f5e4477c127dd9be0b9", "ja": "ううん、実はこれからがキモなんだよねーっ！\nうふっ、女子力、注入～！　ラブラブキュ～ト☆", "zh": "不是，其实接下来的步骤才是重点唷～！\n呵呵，女子力，注入～！LoveLoveCute～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8ab4d3e136a70d14b82872acf00addc40d81bdc2417f4db7d876bb0df541b3c4", "ja": "何をやってるんだ、海美……\n今、何か変なものを入れてなかったか？", "zh": "你在做什么啊，海美……\n你刚才是不是加了什么怪东西进去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "728043922f78e2dc87a389d20be4c3f6d4c9b681ea24dfbd984d901618a94131", "ja": "変じゃないってば！　これはジョシタミンα、\nで、こっちがキャワピタンXだよ？", "zh": "哪里奇怪了！这是「唯她命α」，\n然后这是「可爱糖衣锭X」喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "68237c5301ce0b18f5161b2d5113916e2760e3b343404b6898e39996c7804787", "ja": "ジョシタ……まて、それは本当にスパイスか！？", "zh": "唯她命……等等，那真的是香辛料吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "541a576570c76d612daed5d160dd97c2ecd6162f2375579f62fa820c9512f0e0", "ja": "で、これが一番重要！\nツルスベミンR-2、投入ー！！", "zh": "然后这是最重要的！\n把「正容丸R-2」丢进去──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1012_null", "source_sha256": "a582af480952b039f295201660e581a0933b7ee16965145f42cc99b1ef4ea6c7", "ja": "ザザザーッ！", "zh": "炒炒炒～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "107acc00f7cff68f6ed8c4787ce47f130090be5903d0c16d6c88fa6872eb05bd", "ja": "ああっ！？　罪もない普通のやきそばが、\nどんどんショッキングピンクに……！", "zh": "啊！？无辜的普通炒面，\n渐渐变成萤光粉红色了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "8740b8d15de57ad9173243ed9ed23c2090fc5c93068e2f2c7089cdc84d7692b3", "ja": "ふふっ……！　ただのやきそばとは違うよっ！\nうみみの女子力やきそば、完っ成☆", "zh": "哼哼……！这跟平常的炒面可不一样喔！\n海美美的女子力炒面，完成☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "1e9808317873a1e6f6aae096ffeae9858b7c2faec7da140bb531a21ae9214980", "ja": "えぇ……。", "zh": "咦咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "e2d98cd0cd586c01d0ebcb478b2b66f61572fb526c1deb6f6ea7e92fce4da26d", "ja": "うわぁ……。", "zh": "唔哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "df4f156c5b52d8e7e16740e5c125591d7bf53456cc7c375264addd882cfd61bb", "ja": "さ、みんな味見してみて！　すっごくおいしいよ！", "zh": "来，大家试吃看看！很好吃的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "64c5204a7ede26b46d0ece02cfe45372d6ec22bc3a90b9b78faa66fdcf202d1f", "ja": "せ、せやな。……あ！　紗代子、先食べてええで？\n設営の時も一番がんばっとったし、な！？", "zh": "嘿、嘿呀……啊！纱代子，你可以先吃啊？\n毕竟搭建舞台时你也是最努力的嘛，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "0afc76e19d35739529053fba1f9d91d8b50b2f2277347b339433bc73b861caf6", "ja": "え、で、でもあの……ううっ、でも海美が\n一生懸命に作ってくれたんだし！　いただきま……！", "zh": "咦，可、可是那个……呜呜，\n不过毕竟这是海美拚命做的！我就不客气了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "64f2802365d92b2de675ec0811f28308be10f27d14b08cbda99c4da835e85736", "ja": "待て！", "zh": "等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "4c032b2eda32768e7509153222f590f365f623f9b2bb65989a2d6cd07c433454", "ja": "きゃっ！？　{$P$}……。", "zh": "哇！？{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "64660c782e5114de7a3de8f196bcd6b0eb975f383fbc254de5548d5c7798ab9a", "ja": "ここは一番の年長者として、俺が先に毒味……\nじゃなかった！　味見をする！　……よし！", "zh": "这种时候应该由我这个最年长者身先试毒……\n不对！是试吃！……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8a269a8a87f3f353233b2fef0d1a56955a29847fc3d33d19e6e4e3707b974f53", "ja": "（万が一、万が一のことがあったら……\n社長、みんな、先立つ不孝をお許しください……！）", "zh": "（万一，如果有什么万一……\n社长、大家，请原谅我不孝先离开了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "69a8c127d9d2b9af86fb35928adc9909a5ed8de90eb42debf7244f4c670c26a4", "ja": "薪の追加、もらってきたよ！　そこに置いといたから。\n……って、あれ？　変わった色のやきそば……だよね？", "zh": "我把追加的木柴拿来啰！已经放在那边了。\n……咦？这是颜色很特别的炒面……没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "34109794d2976754995792f1b7a86c7e1729eab117b9493f532e5f4ead0517dc", "ja": "あ、これがウワサの、女子力やきそば！？\nちょっと一口もらっていい？", "zh": "啊，这就是传说中的女子力炒面吗！？\n我可以尝一小口看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "0b0001c3938454740bf144dc6e28ca5967d0937d51e1134e98bfd0c8cc31773b", "ja": "えっ！？　のり子ちゃん、ストップ……！", "zh": "咦！？小法，Stop……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "7a04081268eded8310da29da228403de4fadce760e4e68426b5dc31c547afaaa", "ja": "パクッ。", "zh": "（咬）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "56aeacb836a3d82bedd0c7785c960d28fc88418ac0616b04b6ca4a9b1ad29c06", "ja": "あっ、しまった！　のり子！？", "zh": "啊，糟了！法子！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "540b4a4c86b6d470018f9c5e0ac2ec173bcc69a5c803405e71490f962e9d0aa2", "ja": "こ、これは……胃袋が、しめつけられ……\nストマッククロー、された……ような……。", "zh": "这、这是……我的胃揪成一团……\n好像中了一招……天魔爪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "a6b9b11ef9fb5e9e0d4fe8baede9d5230f30ececc37481e3dd043e84f31d0de0", "ja": "キュ～……。", "zh": "咻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "fb72d16053086368331d0a5719f793a631273dbbe730d764a0e1e78429a3698d", "ja": "の、のり子さん！　しっかりして！", "zh": "法、法子！振作点啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "80db4b5f742c661ad6a0f58b73f6182c5ce3cb9bde64b6b984cf8693049ac40e", "ja": "海美～、やきそばに何入れてん！？\n一口でノックダウンて、女子力ちゃうで！？", "zh": "海美～你在炒面里加了啥啦！？\n一口就把人KO，女子力可没这么威呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "59c7cdf1a6eab88f6fdb7091c9280692e4a6c87945ed20182c346c21f5bcafaf", "ja": "そ、そんな……私はただ、スパイスを……。\nうえぇ～ん！　こんなのってないよー！！", "zh": "怎、怎么会……我只是，加了香辛料……\n呜呜～！怎么这样啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "c79510de61a178991003b506978c9fcdfce1641db007bfaf44a891b9b6ee18c7", "ja": "あっ、海美！\nちょ、ちょっと待って～なっ！", "zh": "啊，海美！\n你、你别走啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "813647fd0d9f1f3a999974729d4b7f7ee93de9443342c132e7d5dc50840da64e", "ja": "奈緒、海美！\n……いや、今はのり子の介抱が先決だな。", "zh": "奈绪、海美！\n……不对，现在应该要优先照顾法子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "867b5742ab10d2b8d6aa7fcd58b60f7b7c173d94aac6e8d0bbdc97efde797f1f", "ja": "{$P$}、手伝います！\nのり子さん、しっかりしてっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，我来帮忙！\n法子，振作点啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_04_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "68b906b054c509b250959f10a010edbab8c2081eb4fbb9c2fd98d3bf0b0954aa", "ja": "タオルもってきたよ！　ひとまず安静にして……\nあと、胃薬もらってくるね！", "zh": "我拿毛巾来了！总之先让她休息一下……\n我再去拿胃药来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
